[{"client_msg_id":"686895d5-d9fc-431c-bcc5-8dba0617b27b","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"まぁ、多分そうでしょうね","ts":"1635256849.033000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R3Elz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f46c4a5-c3b6-4755-966f-a4522138ae5d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"pkg-configとか使ったら楽にならんやろか。","ts":"1635256825.032500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pf6tT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7fc0bfde-aecf-474b-9dc6-622b4373f3a1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ん? これ C++か。","ts":"1635256745.032200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QBZj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76fd7413-6ef7-49bb-bf3e-85549d907622","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"というか、 -L なら include じゃなくて、 lib か","ts":"1635256677.031800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TIMP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d00bcac-1a1d-4bda-a5b2-002db57b07c0","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"`-L/usr/include/Atlas-C++-0.6` はいらないかも","ts":"1635256650.031400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nWLX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd6421e6-b193-449b-9844-fe731ef6d719","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"```g++ -I/usr/include/octave-5.2.0 -pthread oct.c   -L/usr/lib/octave-5.2.0 -Xlinker -loctave -ldl   -llapack -ltmglib -L/usr/include/Atlas-C++-0.6 -lblas -latlas  -lstdc++ -lsupc++```\non Ubuntu 20.04","ts":"1635256430.031000","edited":{"user":"U06ECBRTJ","ts":"1635256491.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D4pz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"651b9181-ea36-4571-917c-f7423c99bc37","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"```#include \u0026lt;stdio.h\u0026gt;\n#include \u0026lt;time.h\u0026gt;\n#include \u0026lt;octave/Matrix.h\u0026gt;\n\n// 正方行列のサイズを指定\n#define DIM 2000\n\nint main( int argc, char **argv )\n{\n  fprintf( stderr, \"start, \\n\" );\n  clock_t c = clock();\n\n  // 行列の積と固有値／固有ベクトル\n  Matrix X(DIM, DIM);\n  Matrix Y(DIM, DIM, 1.0);\n  Matrix Z = X * Y;\n  EIG eig(X);\n\n  fprintf( stderr, \"done, elapsed time = %f [sec]\", ( (double)clock() - (double)c ) / CLOCKS_PER_SEC );\n  return 0;\n}```","ts":"1635256410.030600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TrV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccfb7fae-9db5-4fe6-91fa-fcc80fc5b264","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://www.kkaneko.jp/tools/cygwin/liboctave.html\u003e\nこれを現代のLinux環境で動かすのにすごく手間取った","ts":"1635256383.030300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"agnk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"394033f4-2e82-4f6f-8454-5a638b19c0b1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Vim自体外部プロセスに依存しまくるスタンスなのでそのへんは何も感じないように訓練されてしまった","ts":"1635255177.029900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7WmX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3403553c-4c76-4cfd-89fa-9f3fb837c107","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"あとは GNU Octave かな","ts":"1635253767.029300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1IS5c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5fdd1bb-96f6-47c6-93aa-2c9d8d1a8f64","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"パイプでつなぐのはUnixっぽさがあるので、私はそこまで抵抗ないかな","ts":"1635253694.029000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CInl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1BC26C35-AD88-4880-B158-85683FFD5DD5","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"gnuplot とか　matplotlib cppとか、別の言語を叩いているの、少し気持ち悪くて抵抗があるんですよねぇ……","ts":"1635253604.028400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wLTTM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3cb3418d-7559-40f0-b267-9da4e0f73f89","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"(そしてあまり知らない)","ts":"1635253330.026800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Axqc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b2c74ab-2517-4f53-9eb6-2ddf3eafb1ae","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"グラフ系ライブラリやツール、いろいろあるからなあ","ts":"1635253318.026600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fYu/z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"408412b9-60f3-4920-910a-545944dfb54f","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"gnuplot(震え声","ts":"1635253273.026300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G4HLV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7859d055-944f-4578-8196-c6dc6549ede8","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ライブラリ知らないから、原始的な方法でCSV or TSVに吐いてエクセルとかかしらね。","ts":"1635251487.025900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U02GD5GRJ72"]},{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GJcmo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B3269575-615E-43AD-83FC-314924C0227A","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"皆さんは、c++でデータをグラフに起こしたい時、何を使っていますか？","ts":"1635248312.025200","edited":{"user":"U02GD5GRJ72","ts":"1635248326.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xw0h"}]}]
